<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94109" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐκύ-α</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐκυ-ύη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bottle-gourd,
				Lagenaria vulgaris</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				616a22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.13.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CP</u>
				1.10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. Ἰνδική</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκύντη</span>, Euthyd. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.58f
			</span></i>, cf. Menodor.ib.<i><span class="en">
				59a
			</span></i>: but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span>. distd. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκύντη</span> in Hellespontian dialect,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.59a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκυνθίς</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. πικρά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					4.176
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>gourd</i> used as a calabash, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sammelb.</u>
				7202.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cupping-instrument</i>, because it was shaped like
			the gourd, <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				79e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1405b3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.47.8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>.</div>
